	(text_box "ACS Carrier: 2025 Baby Tweak\n1. Thicc trace - Napkin heat transfer says steady state internal temp is 97C (Protip: Don't paint the rocket flat black). FR-4 melts around 135C, knock 25C off, max rise is then 13C.\n	1oz copper on external layer + 3.5A = 1.44mm trace thickness (https://www.cirexx.com/trace-width-calculator/), future proofing for max 5.8A current with 3mm traces.\n\n2. XA's are rated to 3A, servo wants up to 5.8A, which is a problem. No kill like overkill: XA headers replaced with VH. oh lawd she conducting\n      \n3. Added place for an optional SMD LED, less random wire bits during testing.\n\n4. Earth pads are rounded squares.\n\n5. Changed pads to only front/back and connected layers.\n\nSVH-21T-P1.1 contacts fit AWG22-18. $22 icrimp sn-28 works great.\n\nRat hands out."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 129.54 0)
		(size 137.795 71.12)
		(margins 1.825 1.825 1.825 1.825)
		(stroke
			(width 0.5)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 132 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 205 205 255 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.1 2.1)
				(color 0 0 132 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6fa2f133-a4a5-4935-baa3-414259047d87")
	)
